WEBVTT

00:08.544 --> 00:11.504
Dead men shouldn't go around
messing things up!

00:25.974 --> 00:27.354
Uchiha Reflection.

00:52.754 --> 00:54.424
I'll get the Eight and Nine Tails.

00:54.674 --> 00:57.214
Obito, you take down those two.

00:57.884 --> 00:59.474
- What?!
- You're not getting away!

01:06.564 --> 01:07.274
Obito...

01:07.524 --> 01:09.024
What happened to you?

01:09.644 --> 01:11.104
Why would you join up with him?

01:20.284 --> 01:21.574
<i>Summoning Jutsu!</i>

01:54.024 --> 01:55.314
<i>You're late, Obito!</i>

01:55.984 --> 01:57.194
<i>You're finally here...</i>

01:57.824 --> 01:58.904
<i>You must be Obito.</i>

01:59.234 --> 01:59.994
<i>We've been waiting for you.</i>

02:01.534 --> 02:02.534
<i>Barely made it...</i>

02:02.654 --> 02:03.994
<i>You're really late.</i>

02:04.494 --> 02:06.584
<i>We've already introduced ourselves.</i>

02:07.034 --> 02:08.124
<i>You're the only one left!</i>

02:10.414 --> 02:11.914
<i>I'm going to be the Hokage!</i>

02:12.504 --> 02:13.714
<i>My name's Obito Uchiha!</i>

02:14.044 --> 02:16.344
<i>For my Great Stone Face,</i>

02:16.384 --> 02:21.094
<i>make sure my trademark goggles</i>
<i>and Sharingan are nicely carved out!</i>

02:22.264 --> 02:25.224
<i>So I can glare over</i>
<i>the neighboring lands!</i>

02:26.894 --> 02:30.394
<i>I'll scare the hell out of them</i>
<i>with my Sharingan stare...</i>

02:30.564 --> 02:32.644
<i>and no one will dare</i>
<i>attack our village!</i>

02:33.104 --> 02:35.444
<i>Rattle off your instructions</i>
<i>after you become the Hokage</i>

02:35.484 --> 02:36.984
<i>and activate your Sharingan.</i>

02:37.524 --> 02:38.864
<i>Besides, how can they carve</i>
<i>the Sharingan</i>

02:38.904 --> 02:40.154
<i>if you're wearing goggles?</i>

02:40.484 --> 02:42.994
<i>They can carve it out</i>
<i>over my goggles!</i>

02:43.574 --> 02:46.074
<i>Then it will look like your eyeballs</i>
<i>are popping out.</i>

02:49.034 --> 02:51.504
<i>Anyway... I'm happy that</i>
<i>someone on this team</i>

02:51.504 --> 02:53.544
<i>shares my dream.</i>

02:53.964 --> 02:56.254
<i>I'm Minato. From today,</i>
<i>I'll be your superior.</i>

02:56.294 --> 02:57.004
<i>I'm glad to meet you!</i>

02:57.174 --> 02:57.794
<i>Yeah!</i>

03:01.424 --> 03:02.554
<i>Minato Sensei...</i>

03:04.764 --> 03:06.474
<i>All of this...</i>

03:09.474 --> 03:10.764
<i>This world...</i>

03:15.734 --> 03:17.524
- <i>None of it matters anymore!</i>
- <i>None of it matters anymore!</i>

03:43.674 --> 03:45.424
I'm not gonna let
that happen, idiot!

03:46.054 --> 03:48.934
I'm the son of
the Fourth Hokage, you know!

03:49.474 --> 03:51.934
I'm not gonna fall for your talk!

03:53.724 --> 03:54.524
I see.

03:54.734 --> 03:56.064
I was going easy on you

03:56.104 --> 03:58.354
because you were
the actual Jinchuriki, not a clone.

03:58.604 --> 04:00.944
but if that's how you feel,
I won't hold back on you!

04:01.484 --> 04:03.364
This is Hashirama's wooden dragon,

04:03.404 --> 04:05.444
which he used to hold down
my Nine Tails long ago.

04:10.374 --> 04:12.534
Madara really is crazy powerful.

04:14.494 --> 04:17.214
That's what makes him
worth fighting.

04:19.374 --> 04:21.844
Your tough guy act is crazy solid.

04:22.384 --> 04:24.844
I'm not going to hold back
against a zombie either!

04:25.634 --> 04:26.924
Since you're already dead!

04:50.494 --> 04:50.864
Why?!

04:51.874 --> 04:53.534
Why ally yourself with someone
like Madara?

04:57.004 --> 04:59.464
I've got nothing to say to you.

05:00.374 --> 05:01.634
All that's left...

05:03.544 --> 05:05.004
is this final battle!

