06:36.094 --> 06:40.474
Kakashi's Resolve

06:46.484 --> 06:47.194
Earth Style...

06:47.404 --> 06:48.274
Mud Wall!

07:01.914 --> 07:02.664
Why?

07:03.334 --> 07:05.374
How about shutting up already?

07:05.584 --> 07:07.794
You're only talk.
You're nothing but a piece of trash.

07:36.244 --> 07:39.874
<i>I believe that the White Fang</i>
<i>was a true hero.</i>

07:41.204 --> 07:43.704
<i>Sure, in the world of Ninja,</i>

07:43.834 --> 07:46.124
<i>one who breaks</i>
<i>the rules and regulations</i>

07:46.374 --> 07:47.674
<i>is regarded as trash.</i>

07:48.294 --> 07:52.804
<i>But those who abandon</i>
<i>their comrades...</i>

07:53.254 --> 07:54.804
<i>are worse than trash!</i>

07:55.464 --> 07:57.424
<i>This is probably...</i>

07:58.184 --> 08:01.934
<i>because you let Rin die.</i>

08:14.444 --> 08:16.154
<i>I am trash for sure...</i>

08:18.614 --> 08:21.324
<i>But Obito, you've always...</i>

08:22.374 --> 08:22.744
Kamui...

08:24.244 --> 08:25.834
<i>... been my hero.</i>

08:28.164 --> 08:29.084
<i>So why?</i>

08:31.334 --> 08:33.094
Damn it!

08:48.024 --> 08:49.444
That damned wooden thing!

08:49.484 --> 08:51.274
It's absorbing
the Nine Tails' chakra!

08:58.324 --> 08:59.954
Damn it...

09:09.004 --> 09:10.254
We have the same eyes...

09:10.714 --> 09:12.254
So you made it out, huh?

09:12.754 --> 09:15.294
Obito, how did you end up like this?

09:18.804 --> 09:21.344
Does it have to do with Rin?

09:35.274 --> 09:36.614
<i>I'll protect my comrades!</i>

09:40.244 --> 09:41.654
<i>Let's go rescue Rin right now!</i>

09:44.574 --> 09:45.204
<i>Yeah!</i>

10:05.344 --> 10:08.474
I said, trash should keep
their mouths shut!

10:09.264 --> 10:10.024
Die.

10:11.184 --> 10:14.774
I... couldn't keep
my promise to you.

10:15.444 --> 10:18.904
You're right. I'm trash.

10:20.984 --> 10:22.244
But you...

10:22.744 --> 10:24.114
You're a hero of the Leaf.

10:25.114 --> 10:27.164
There's no reason for you
to become trash too.

10:41.844 --> 10:43.304
This is reality.

10:43.804 --> 10:46.184
Those who bequeath
and the bequeathed... both.

10:48.224 --> 10:51.974
All shinobi who survive
in this world become trash.

10:52.314 --> 10:54.314
You and I are prime examples,

10:54.814 --> 10:55.814
Kakashi.

10:57.814 --> 10:58.904
<i>Kakashi Sensei...</i>

11:00.944 --> 11:01.944
I can't move...

11:12.294 --> 11:14.754
These guys are a distraction
for you too, right?

11:15.254 --> 11:17.374
This world is about
to come to an end.

11:17.884 --> 11:20.714
So in order to enjoy
the little time we've got left...

11:20.754 --> 11:23.964
Let's clear out this battlefield first.

11:28.764 --> 11:33.224
No one can escape the cycle
that gives birth to trash in this world.

11:33.474 --> 11:36.444
That's why I intend
to remake the world!

11:42.234 --> 11:46.614
You guys make me so mad,
I can't even think straight.

11:47.204 --> 11:50.324
So instead, let me tell you
something about myself.

12:03.304 --> 12:05.384
I'm not trash!

12:06.014 --> 12:07.934
I'm not planning on
becoming trash either!

12:09.594 --> 12:10.344
I will...

12:11.684 --> 12:12.394
stop you!

12:17.684 --> 12:21.154
- I'll never let my comrades die!
- I'll never let my comrades die!

12:33.244 --> 12:36.374
<i>I'll never let my comrades die!</i>

12:38.124 --> 12:39.464
<i>I'm sorry, Naruto.</i>

12:40.424 --> 12:43.174
<i>I'm the one who taught you</i>
<i>Obito's words, and yet...</i>

12:43.384 --> 12:44.754
<i>I was about to waver again.</i>

13:02.944 --> 13:04.194
Hirudora!

13:04.194 --> 13:05.154
Lightning Blade!

13:11.664 --> 13:13.494
Guess it wasn't just a bluff.

13:19.714 --> 13:20.334
Obito...

13:21.504 --> 13:23.464
Your once strong will
is still alive today...

13:23.504 --> 13:25.094
Right next to me!

13:25.634 --> 13:29.724
What the current me can do
is protect the current Naruto!

13:50.224 --> 13:52.314
You'll protect the current Naruto?

13:58.024 --> 14:00.324
Same here...

14:01.154 --> 14:02.654
<i>They're both at their limits!</i>

14:03.154 --> 14:05.824
<i>These Hidden Leaf guys</i>
<i>sure love to act tough!</i>

14:14.624 --> 14:16.464
The wood's constriction
is weakening.

14:22.674 --> 14:23.594
Octopops!

14:25.134 --> 14:26.224
Ow oww!

14:27.054 --> 14:28.094
Be careful, Naruto!

14:28.764 --> 14:31.684
The enemy's Wood Paralysis is identical
to the First Hokage's!

14:32.104 --> 14:34.104
It has the power to
bind Tailed Beast Power!

14:35.274 --> 14:37.024
Like Captain Yamato's technique...

14:46.154 --> 14:48.114
A Lightning Blade that relies
on the Sharingan...

14:48.414 --> 14:51.454
You've mastered your left eye...

14:52.284 --> 14:53.494
Even awakening the Mangekyo.

14:54.834 --> 14:58.874
But can you make it back
from the other plane

14:59.124 --> 15:00.254
in your current condition?

15:12.054 --> 15:14.064
Go back to the trash heap, Kakashi!

15:15.104 --> 15:16.684
Kakashi Sensei...

15:19.354 --> 15:22.234
is just like... me!

15:31.374 --> 15:33.784
Looks like we're gonna have to
start worrying about Ten Tails.

15:34.244 --> 15:36.204
Let them handle Obito.

15:38.714 --> 15:41.134
Then we'll make our move!

15:46.094 --> 15:47.924
Now I see it clearly...

15:57.854 --> 16:00.194
your pained face.

16:03.814 --> 16:07.194
Save those lines for
the one right next to you.

16:10.404 --> 16:13.624
<i>I definitely have to help</i>
<i>Kakashi Sensei somehow.</i>

16:13.664 --> 16:16.334
<i>He's completely drained from</i>
<i>overusing the Sharingan.</i>

16:16.834 --> 16:18.624
<i>If he gets sucked in...</i>

16:20.374 --> 16:23.214
Naruto, switch with me...

16:23.584 --> 16:24.254
Huh?

16:24.594 --> 16:26.214
Let me handle this.

16:26.714 --> 16:27.304
But...

16:28.094 --> 16:29.844
Don't argue. Just switch!

16:34.304 --> 16:36.604
Hey, Kakashi brat,
give me your hands...

16:37.224 --> 16:38.104
You're...

16:39.064 --> 16:40.734
Never mind that!
Just stick out your hands!

17:05.084 --> 17:07.754
Kurama! What the hell
did you just do?

17:08.254 --> 17:10.014
Now you don't have any distractions.

17:10.344 --> 17:12.474
I'm leaving the rest to you, Naruto.

17:13.474 --> 17:14.054
What?!

17:18.264 --> 17:19.264
Damn!

17:34.954 --> 17:38.334
Now that we know how
your ability works, I can counter it.

17:39.084 --> 17:41.044
Here's another!

17:47.384 --> 17:50.394
Oh yeah, that certainly
is a pained face Obito.

17:52.064 --> 17:52.764
What's going on?

17:56.234 --> 17:58.144
Kakashi did that. Over there.

17:58.444 --> 18:00.274
The difference between
you and me is...

18:01.024 --> 18:04.114
I can give or take chakra
voluntarily at will.

18:04.444 --> 18:07.494
I'll show you how it's done later.

18:08.494 --> 18:09.994
When did you pass it to him?

18:10.324 --> 18:13.334
When I grabbed his hand
to throw him.

18:16.254 --> 18:16.754
So then...!

18:17.084 --> 18:18.924
Yeah, whenever he wants to,

18:18.964 --> 18:21.214
